"Reads the login saved in ~/.grok/auth.json. No Keychain prompt." = "讀取 ~/.grok/auth.json 中儲存的登入資訊。不會出現鑰匙圈提示。";
"Uses a key entered in Settings, or reads OpenCode's auth.json. No Keychain prompt." = "使用在設定中輸入的金鑰，或讀取 OpenCode 的 auth.json。不會出現鑰匙圈提示。";
