/* Extensions */
"An extension is a program you add yourself that reports one account's usage. Pulse draws what it prints as a ring, runs it only once you switch it on, and gives it no credentials." = "擴充功能是你自己加入的程式，用來回報某一個帳號的用量，Pulse 會把它輸出的資料畫成圓環。只有你開啟後 Pulse 才會執行它，也不會交給它任何登入憑證。";
"Another extension already uses the id %@." = "另一個擴充功能已經在用 ID「%@」。";
"Couldn't be used" = "無法使用";
"Each extension is a folder of its own, holding pulse-extension.json and its program." = "每個擴充功能各自一個資料夾，裡面放 pulse-extension.json 和它的程式。";
"Extension" = "擴充功能";
"Extension program" = "擴充功能程式";
"Extensions" = "擴充功能";
"Extensions folder" = "擴充功能資料夾";
"Folder" = "資料夾";
"Found" = "已找到";
"From its pulse-extension.json. Pulse keeps this extension's settings under it." = "來自它的 pulse-extension.json。Pulse 用這個 ID 儲存這個擴充功能的設定。";
"How to write an extension" = "如何撰寫擴充功能";
"Id" = "ID";
"Its id must be lowercase letters, digits, dots, dashes or underscores, 64 at most." = "ID 只能使用小寫字母、數字、句點、連字號和底線，最多 64 個字元。";
"Its name is empty." = "名稱是空的。";
"Its program has to be inside its own folder." = "程式必須放在擴充功能自己的資料夾裡。";
"Its program isn't there, or isn't executable." = "找不到它的程式，或者程式無法執行。";
"Look again" = "重新尋找";
"Manage extensions" = "管理擴充功能";
"No pulse-extension.json in this folder." = "這個資料夾裡沒有 pulse-extension.json。";
"None yet" = "還沒有";
"Program" = "程式";
