"Read from Claude Code's own records: each reply says whether it cached for an hour or five minutes, and a cache lasts that long from the last request that used it. That is the time if nothing before it has changed — switching model, changing tools or compacting starts a new cache. Subagents keep caches of their own and are not listed." = "資料來自 Claude Code 自己的紀錄。每次回覆都會註明快取保留 1 小時還是 5 分鐘，從最後一次用到它的請求算起。這是上下文沒變時的時長：換模型、改工具或壓縮對話，都會重新開始一份快取。子 Agent 有自己的快取，這裡不列出。";
