"Read from Codex's own records: the model each request used, and when it was sent. On GPT-5.6 and later, OpenAI keeps a cache available for at least 30 minutes after it was last used, and may keep it longer — so this is the time it is guaranteed, not when it ends. Earlier models have no stated lifetime and are not listed. Under heavy traffic a request can still miss within this time." = "資料來自 Codex 自己的紀錄：每次請求用的模型和送出時間。OpenAI 保證 GPT-5.6 及之後的模型，快取在最後一次使用後至少保留 30 分鐘，實際可能更久，所以這裡顯示的是保底時間，不是確切的過期時間。更早的模型官方沒有提供時長，這裡不列出。請求很密集時，即使在這段時間內也可能沒有命中。";
